@startuml
title ERS Authorization — Intrinsic vs Delegated

actor "Authenticated Person" as User

rectangle "Tenant Actor" as Actor
rectangle "Person–Tenant Membership" as Membership
rectangle "Global Person" as Person

rectangle "Intrinsic Self-Service" as Self {
  rectangle "Own Person record"
  rectangle "Own historical Earnings"
  rectangle "Own historical Expenses"
}

rectangle "Collaborator Capabilities" as Collab {
  rectangle "Current Work Assignments"
  rectangle "Current Earnings / Expenses"
}

rectangle "Delegated Authorization" as Delegated {
  rectangle "Tenant Administrator"
  rectangle "Earnings Operator"
  rectangle "Expenses Operator"
}

User --> Actor
Actor --> Membership
Membership --> Person

Person --> Self

Membership --> Collab : if active\nCollaborator Journey

Actor --> Delegated : via Role Grants

note bottom of Self
NOT granted by PERSON Role.

Derived from identity:
Actor → Membership → Person.
end note

note bottom of Delegated
Explicit Role / Role Grant.
end note

@enduml